    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University has launched a research office in Mombasa to improve health and education in the coastal region, working closely with local government to define priority areas of focus. The research office will help address many health-related challenges which have led to high morbidity and mortality from preventable illness in the region.",
